{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle cultivation, endless growth</strong><br>Meditate and break through realms step by step. Progress continues even while offline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique circular battle system</strong><br>Inspired by cultivation duels: spiritual power clashes within two opposing circles. Weapons, artifacts, and manuals (Xinfa) combine into endless strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich cultivation life</strong><br>Gather spiritual wood, stones, and herbs; forge weapons and treasures; refine pills; and inscribe talismans or gems to enhance your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons, artifacts, and manuals</strong><br>Equip Xinfa manuals that trigger automatic skills. Attach talismans to gear to gain elemental powers like fire, ice, lightning, or poison.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pills and tactical combat</strong><br>Use pills in battle to heal or gain buffs. Smart timing can turn defeat into victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonds and relationships</strong><br>Meet diverse NPCs, build relationships, advance storylines, and even form Dao partnerships or cultivate alongside spirit pets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystic realms and adventures</strong><br>Challenge secret realms, defeat monsters, and discover rare resources or fate-changing encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The road to immortality</strong><br>From humble beginnings to legendary ascension, every choice shapes your destiny. Walk alone or with companions\u2014the path is yours to decide.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052060?t=1770639253","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052060/2261e54769d66b2353543ee0641667e3a59f0964/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770639253","capsule_image":